    {
      "id": "2:65",
      "text": [
        "Srisu · v1",
        "A private space for two.",
        "White pages, warm cards, one charcoal action per screen. Colour is punctuation — violet for anything shared, and a small family of bright glyph colours for the things people do. Everything below is rendered from the live components."
      ]
    },
