        "Illustration",
        "Two sleepy hills — two people — under a low sun. Always at natural height so the hilltops aren't cropped.",
        "Landscape",
        "Hills strip & union mark",
        "Rules of thumb",
        "One charcoal primary button per screen.",
        "Violet tint (--together-soft) means “shared with your person”.",
        "Each activity keeps its colour: Spark violet, Ask sky, Planner sun.",
        "Nested corners = outer radius − padding (32 − 8 = 24).",
        "Sections: 20pt gutter, 28pt between, title 20 bold.",
        "Avatars are circles; pairs overlap by a quarter with a 4pt ring.",
        "Hairline borders over shadows; shadows only for floating things.",
        "Motion is gentle: sunrise on illustrations, pulse only to teach."
